      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e3709c68af02747",
      "translationZh": "我正在让 AI 模型玩 Cat Goric，这是我在 2021 年 js13kGames 期间制作的一款 2D 平台游戏：https://js13kgames.com/games/cat-goric-escape-from-the-warp-chamber",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bb9a70ea0dae6f5",
      "translationZh": "目前最好的成绩是在一次连续游玩中通关了 14 个可玩关卡中的 8 个。到目前为止，有两个模型通关了八个关卡：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c13d7e8f83f88385",
      "translationZh": "如果你想让我试试某个特定模型，请在评论中说出它的名字。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42bc36d93d1bd0b7",
      "translationZh": "你也可以尝试用自己选择的模型通关这款游戏。项目在这里，其中包含使用不同模型/引擎运行这项挑战的说明：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21f65d23e4172352",
      "translationZh": "https://github.com/felladrin/ai-plays-cat-goric（欢迎提交 PR！）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b84158a17dceb151",
      "translationZh": "另外，附上了一段 Clef 通关八个关卡的 2 分钟录像（模型思考时游戏会暂停，因此视频经过了时间压缩处理）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
